<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 72px 0px 72px', background: '#F5F8F2', position: 'relative' }}>

  <Box style={{ height: 108, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 600, color: '#056526', letterSpacing: 2.4 }}>DUAL MODE</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0B1F14', letterSpacing: -0.6, marginTop: 8 }}>Two ways to run the same scan</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 532, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 52 }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 664 }}>

      <Box style={{ padding: '20px 24px', background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.1)', borderLeft: '4px solid #056526', borderRadius: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 600, color: '#056526', letterSpacing: 1.8 }}>ON-DEVICE</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.45)' }}>works with no signal</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14', marginTop: 10 }}>Offline classification</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>
          A TensorFlow.js model downloaded to the phone runs the four gates and the classifier locally. The page is cached by a service worker, so the app opens on a dead connection.
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26, marginTop: 14, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.08)', paddingTop: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.55)' }}>Cost: ~1 MB runtime + weights</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.55)' }}>Queue: IndexedDB, syncs on reconnect</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ padding: '20px 24px', background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.1)', borderLeft: '4px solid #A4DA22', borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 600, color: '#056526', letterSpacing: 1.8 }}>GATEWAY</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.45)' }}>needs a session</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14', marginTop: 10 }}>Online classification</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>
          A Supabase Edge Function calls a hosted Roboflow model. The API key lives only in the function environment — it never reaches the browser, and the function enforces a 12 requests/minute limit per user.
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26, marginTop: 14, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.08)', paddingTop: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.55)' }}>Auth: valid JWT + active farmer profile</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.55)' }}>Missing secret → model_not_configured</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>

      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 600, color: '#056526', letterSpacing: 1.8 }}>FALLBACK ORDER</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginTop: 14, paddingBottom: 10, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.08)' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 18 }}>1</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>Online gateway</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.55)', marginTop: 2 }}>Highest accuracy. Needs a session and a connection.</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, paddingTop: 10, paddingBottom: 10, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.08)' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 18 }}>2</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>On-device model</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.55)', marginTop: 2 }}>Works offline once the weights are downloaded.</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, paddingTop: 10 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#056526', width: 18 }}>3</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0B1F14' }}>Documented heuristic</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.55)', marginTop: 2 }}>No model at all. Recorded as heuristic_fallback.</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(5,101,38,0.06)', padding: '18px 20px', borderRadius: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.7)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
          Whichever path ran is written into the result payload as its provenance. A heuristic reading is never displayed as if a model produced it.
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.12)', paddingTop: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 600, color: '#056526', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>WHAT THE TRADE-OFF COSTS</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
          The on-device model is smaller and measurably less accurate than the hosted one. That gap is the price of working where there is no signal at all.
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.12)', paddingTop: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 15, fontStyle: 'italic', color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.7)', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
          The offline model is the fallback, not the headline. It exists for the fields the gateway cannot reach.
        </Text>
      </Box>

    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 16, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,31,20,0.1)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.45)' }}>AgriSuri PH · Product Scope</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(11,31,20,0.45)' }}>08 / 19</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
